## Design Principles (Locked)

These are the rules every future contributor must follow.

1. **Engine 5 measures only.** It never decides.
2. **Engine 6 decides only.** It never renders.
3. **Engine 7 renders only.** It never analyzes.
4. **All geometry is independent of Flutter.** Pure Dart classes only in Engines 5 and 6.
5. **Every engine exposes immutable data models.** (`@immutable` on all data classes.)
6. **Every engine is unit-testable without a camera.** Mock data must be sufficient.
7. **The UI is replaceable** without changing any mathematical logic.
8. **New pose categories are added through configuration**, not algorithm changes (`GuidanceConfig`).
